      "message": "I don\u0027t think SystemApi(MODULE_LIBRARIES) makes sense for string constants.\n\nIf you need to limit who can receive or send the broadcast, you need to use a permission that\u0027s likely a PRIV permission, and you\u0027d use @SystemApi(PRIV_ALL) with @RequiresPermission.\n\nIf there\u0027s no permission and any apps can send it anyway, then you can make then public.\n\nMODULE_LIBRARIES doesn\u0027t really protect anything here, so you probably want to do either of the above.",
